{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_spikes_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_spikes_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "親愛的蘭道爾",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_spikes_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "11767be954636b486fc7344f75f6b4951d0ef8f8cc131c71b94348e144c5689d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g5_spiralstairs"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭道爾·霍夫斯塔特同學，你的信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這還真是難得，我不記得自己有會寫信給我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人心陰晴不定，就像前些天的那場暴雨。託它的福，這批信件都遭殃了。寄件人資訊被雨水浸濕導致看不清楚，但願別出差錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有問題，這是我遠在家鄉的母親寄來的信件，謝謝您，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就放心啦，祝你今天過得愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g6_towerterrace"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傲慢的學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佩恩！交給你的事辦好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "譏諷的學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看他驚慌失措的樣子，真沒出息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辦……辦好了，維克托少爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布萊妮，你看我說過什麼？佩恩不會辜負我們的“友誼”，他的反應怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不太確定……可能蘭道爾同學並不相信我胡編亂造的那些說辭……不然還是算——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你的麻煩就大了啊，佩恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "獨自一人來萊塔尼亞求學不容易，我欣賞你在法術方面的天賦和勤懇的態度，學院設立的獎學金是所有渴求知識的學徒應得的回報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，塵埃落定前誰知道會出現什麼變數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "入選者必須經歷嚴格的資格審查，對你來說以優異的成績通過期末考試並不是難事，但最終還是要得到委員會的認可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維克托老爺……您的叔父也在評議委員會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再過一週才會正式公布獎學金入選者的名單哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……會確保蘭道爾同學赴約。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g5_spiralstairs"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "捧著這麼高的書，需要小心一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對、對不起，蘭道爾同學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你認識我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……我們大概上過同一門選修課？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "答對了，佩恩學長。你對現有施術單元所應相容的源石能量轉化類型持有極具創新性的看法，把埃德溫教授氣壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳……幸好在考核上他還是公正的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相比之下我就沒那麼幸運了。不過理論一向不是我擅長的領域，那些概念就算再過五、六十年也不會有什麼重大發展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毒理學的課在另一棟樓，下次再見，學長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g5_spiralstairs"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佩恩學長，我們最近還真是經常見面啊，我都要開始懷疑這是不是陰謀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，你的反應真有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能在異國他鄉找到聊得來的朋友真的不容易，更何況我們都是留學生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離家太久我都不記得家人的樣子了，他們也……不太寫信給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信……我最近倒是收到了母親的來信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得信怎麼樣？不……我是說，出了什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們想來看望我，但我不確定自己想不想見他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你必須去見他們！呃……不管發生什麼事，家人始終是關心你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "學長很想讓我赴約？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有！這完全是你自己的選擇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我需要好好想想，不如……過幾天再寄封回信給他們吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭道爾同學，你……會去見他們的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "學長怎麼比我還著急。不是你說的嗎？這完全是我的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟了，萬一他拒絕……我該怎麼跟維克托少爺交代！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g3_ludwigsuniv_outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信使先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭道爾同學，午安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是信件出了什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，感謝您帶來母親的問候。只是很久沒跟家人聯絡，有些肺腑之言實在難以開口。雖然母親交代了無需回信，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白，離家遠行之人總是近鄉情怯。你的信件我保證會送到。只是……我們無法寄回原本的地址。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雙親留下了一個落腳的地址，送到這裡就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題，祝你們見面愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您，我想會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，在外求學的孩子真辛苦啊，不過我的工作也不輕鬆，接下來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請、請等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲，這不是小佩恩嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，今天終於打算把信寄出去了？兩個和家人團聚的異鄉人，祝福你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是來寄信的……我是想問您能不能把蘭道爾同學的信給我，我來幫您送信呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣不好吧，讓一個孩子幫我工作，領薪水的時候怎麼能安心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信使先生，沒關係啦，我對巴赫區很熟，不會送錯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道信上的地址？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……我……蘭、蘭道爾同學是我最好的朋友！他的父母已經到了萊塔尼亞但因為一些……對……一些不可抗力所以已經換了住處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我昨天在街上遇到了他們如果您現在還是按照原來的地址寄送的話他們就收不到蘭道爾同學言辭懇切的真摯回信了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下等一下，小佩恩，你太緊張了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了，蘭道爾同學一定是你很重要的朋友，你不想他和家人的會面出問題對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好孩子，那這封信就麻煩你了，下次讓我幫你送出你自己寫給家人的信件吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從我們第一次見面已經過去了三年，別再猶豫啦。無論之前發生了什麼，父母收到孩子的來信總是高興的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您先生，我會……考慮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜託了……千萬別拒絕……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太、太好了！明天晚上他會準時赴約，我得告訴維克托少爺和布萊妮小姐，讓他們準備——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來他跟家人的關係也不太融洽。研究工作……呵，當然是因為工作……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“請別對此次會面寄予過度期望，我當然會因你們的到來感到欣喜，只是萊塔尼亞陌生的街景時刻提醒著我，我還是孤身一人。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，他也是孤身一人，但是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維克托少爺不會放過我的，我必須這樣做，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得再想想……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g2_marigold_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時間差不多了，布萊妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真會使喚人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我們的新玩具一點小小的尊重，來日方長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定他會來？我們的時間是很寶貴的，如果超過了約定的時間還看不到人影——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就得跟獎學金和僅剩一年的平靜校園生活告別了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，維克托少爺，您無需重複。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾天沒見面脾氣變大了，不過現在這樣倒是更順眼一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓，有人來了。佩恩，準備好你的施術單元，聽我口令……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蠢貨！你在做什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第2號賦格街……這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問是蘭道爾·霍夫斯塔特同學嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是巴赫區的信使，受一對薩科塔夫婦的委託在這裡等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g2_marigold_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼時候你能面不改色地說謊了？意外，手術費，那傢伙竟然真的相信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留學生很難及時獲得故鄉的音訊，即便是謊言也無法在短時間內求證。同樣的，我們的思念、擔憂、後悔……也無法讓家人知曉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓住他的弱點，之後他才會成為你接下來幾年裡最“忠誠”的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……說得不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個包裹裡的東西就是他身上最值錢的了？要是他的倒楣父母真的遭受天災，這可能還不夠付醫療費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個發育不良的薩科塔小子能拿出什麼有價值的東西？要我說還不如在他身上試試新法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭道爾的父母是研究拉特蘭銃的學者，兩人所在的研究院受到官方資助，他的家境應該不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他留下的東西裡還有關於銃的研究成果，想必兩位的父親也會很高興的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼時候你這麼瞭解他了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三年了佩恩，你終於開竅了！可惜你明年就要畢業了，我會懷念我們的友誼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也會的，維克托少爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g2_marigold_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有沒有聞到一股很淡的香味？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從別人手裡騙來的才不會是什麼體面的禮物，而且我的生日已經過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳……現在聞到了，這是什麼？等等，盒子怎麼是空的？該死，那個薩科塔騙了我們……維克托，你的臉怎麼看起來這麼搞笑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的臉難道就很好看嗎？不對，不對勁，有什麼東西正沿著我的腳趾向上爬！還是……我在下沉？改變地形的源石技藝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地面晃得好厲害……維克托過來扶我一下，扶——這、這是什麼？綠色的黏液……我的寶石戒指……不，不！我的手指怎麼不見了！我好像在……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "融化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位只當我是孤立無援的留學生，卻未曾想過是我主動避開了人群？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "腐蝕、分解、消融，這是我的源石技藝，也是從小伴隨我的天賦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很少與人分享這些，也沒多少人願意瞭解破壞和死亡的原理。怎麼樣，現在我有資格成為你們的“新朋友”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佩恩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死！我早就該想到你們這些異邦人沆瀣一氣。叛徒！你等著，我會讓你付出沉重的代價！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不勞費心。參與你們的惡意玩笑已經讓我背負上了最沉痛的代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_leithanienroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惡作劇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的萬分抱歉，蘭道爾同學！你收到的那封信……是我寫的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同為孤身求學的留學生我不應該依從貴族子弟的役使寫信騙你……明天請你千萬不要赴約！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道信是假的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有印章，沒有署名，沒有拉特蘭銃的潤滑油的氣味，而且我選擇前往萊塔尼亞求學時那兩個人未曾流露過一絲猶豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們十分欣慰，彷彿我的選擇幫他們解決了一道難題。可從小到大，他們的研究才是最會惹麻煩的“孩子”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使我來到萊塔尼亞，那位佔據了所有關注的“兄長”還不讓我安心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "貪婪無能的競爭者試圖透過我騙取研究的秘密，我怎麼會放過這些輕視我的敵人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大部分來到萊塔尼亞的求學者是為了探索源石技藝精妙絕倫的奧秘，我也是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過有時候用毒理學來解決“麻煩”其實更省事——只需一點點特殊的墨水，就能讓甜美的文字變成致命的符號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，我應該想到那群脫離研究院之後還披著學者皮的政客不至於模仿得如此粗糙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我以為這封信也是“那種麻煩”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你是說……不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遺憾，看來我們之間產生了一點小誤會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過先找上門的是你們，我不會道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈……哈哈……從我答應成為他們的幫兇開始，我就做好了被報復的準備，這才是傀儡最大的用途。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是這次的代價……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是有點難以接受，你可以回到你自己的宿舍慢慢消化這個噩耗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說你想要向我復仇？我不介意，只是這次的手法得聰明點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還有多長時間……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按經驗判斷，最短三天，最多不超過一週。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維克托他們已經知道你準備赴約的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，那是我放出的誘餌，總不能讓惡作劇輕易結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你敲門之前我正為回敬他們做準備，剛好可以試試我新開發的試劑，就當作是期末複習了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算我一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？向敵人投誠沒什麼可信度啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然外出求學有一部分理由是逃避家人，但我選擇這所學院是為了索取知識，而非成為貴族的僕從。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的敵人從來只有他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g2_marigold_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他只會說這一句嗎？我真搞不懂你怎麼會被這種無聊的小角色使喚了三年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使作為頤指氣使的壞學生，他們惡作劇的程度也讓人不敢恭維——傳統、沒效率、缺乏新意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不懂，最一開始可能是為了平穩度過學校生活吧，沒想到順從卻讓我置身更大的危險中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看他們現在站都站不起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快……快把你的法術停下來！叫保健室的老師過來！要不然，我是不會放過你們的！你不想要你的全額獎學金了嗎？佩恩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有你蘭道爾，學校禁止私下使用具有攻擊性的法術，等著退學吧！萊塔尼亞不接受你，你也回不了拉特蘭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們既沒有認清自己的境遇，又沒搞懂我的源石技藝的本質。這不是攻擊法術，而是由我親手調配的試劑引發的幻覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……幻覺？不可能！我很確定痛感是真實的，它們已經沒過我的腰……快點停下來！你別想騙過我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我討厭解釋惡作劇的原理，你們就不能變聰明一點自行領悟嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在旁人看來你們只是摔了一跤，然後扯著自己的頭髮和小腿亂吼亂叫罷了，我沒有對你們造成任何實際傷害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於那些肢體融化的場景，是我個人的小愛好。學校的規章還是太保守了，我只能把這點小小的夢想放到幻覺裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪物……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝誇獎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維克托、布萊妮，你們不會對別人說出今晚的事，蘭道爾設計的“惡作劇”也不會留下任何證據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你打算向自己親愛的叔父吹耳邊風，那就隨時做好陷入瀕死幻覺的準備吧，蘭道爾慷慨地把試劑配方分享給我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1129_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維克托，快點答應他！我已經感覺不到自己的腿了……快點啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佩恩，我不會跟任何人提起今晚發生的事……請、請你和蘭道爾同學放過我們吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再找一個“新朋友”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1131_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕對不會！我發誓，你是最後一個！不，你現在也不是了，我不會再找你麻煩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭道爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實驗還蠻成功的，你們的尖叫聲合格了。看在你們是不錯的實驗品的分上，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這樣解決了……三年來揮之不去的陰雲，就這樣逃走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來也不是什麼複雜的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有無辜的學生遭受欺辱，沒有計劃失敗之後的拳打腳踢，我的獎學金也安然無恙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來反抗並沒有想像中的那麼難，為什麼到現在才明白？但我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是不會道歉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……你根本不需要。作惡本應遭受報應，是我咎由自取。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭道爾，能麻煩你幫我寄封信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那封給你父母的信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的雙親並不支持我來萊塔尼亞留學。他們是商人，世代經營家族企業，身為獨子的我理所當然地成了繼承人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法術典籍陪我度過孤獨的童年，他們不會源石技藝也不感興趣，只是知道我喜歡所以投其所好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想向他們低頭，不想向他們求助，哪怕我正遭受不公正的待遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我還是每天都去郵局查詢郵件，妄想著如果他們願意主動關心，那我也會毫不猶豫地寄出這封早就寫好的回信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在堅持和對峙都沒有意義了。其實我有點想念母親做的果醬餡餅，我一直知道那是商家生產的半成品，但她會加上自己的香料配方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我討厭甜食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過如果你想吃的話，回家不就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈……真會開玩笑。我還有多久，兩天？五天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不出意外的話還有幾十年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……告訴我，你不是在開玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遺憾，不是玩笑。回信用的墨水根本不是什麼致命的毒藥，你還有機會吃到那個聽起來不怎麼美味的餡餅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初只是想把你嚇走罷了，沒想到你不是那種容易慌張失措的書呆子……很失望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……嗚……我從來沒有這麼開心過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，擦擦眼淚。這並不是我期待的反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，蘭道爾。你看，哈哈……我哭得太厲害手都不聽使喚了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？我……的手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只說了墨水不致命，但沒有說裡面沒有毒哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，只是普通的水腫，讓你暫時失去操縱手指的能力。72小時後就能恢復正常，這個懲罰比毒發身亡輕多了吧。不對，讓我算算時間——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！這會讓你剛好錯過期末的第一門考試，你的獎學金好像還是泡湯了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈……我早該想到的，這才是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是寫下“挑戰書”的人，當然在我的“回敬”之列。而且之前你對那兩個人百依百順、畏手畏腳的，讓人感覺真不舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再也不會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……蘭道爾啊，你幫我解決了一個麻煩，卻又帶來了新的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這下，我明年的學費該怎麼辦呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟他們聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的信都是現成的，只要改幾個字就能寄出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我是怎麼識破那個詭計的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說過我的信寫得很粗糙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那兩個人不會寫信給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信紙、口吻、氣味，偵探小說裡作為蛛絲馬跡的常客並非我看透惡作劇的有力證據，信件本身就毫無意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們連當面說出一句噓寒問暖的話都做不到，更別說寫那種肉麻到不行的信——當然我對他們本來就沒有任何期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那封假信是你希望自己收到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的父母曾經那樣關心過你，你想要證明自己對於他們依舊重要，甚至為此提前準備了回信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是很傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不是因為你寫了信，而是因為你寫了卻不敢寄出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會勸你向他們低頭，你做了正確的決定，而他們做錯了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他們將這封信看作示弱，那就沮喪、憤怒、撕碎紙張，再告訴他們這不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想做就做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭道爾，為什麼你能如此自信地做每個決定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為沒有人告訴我，我做得不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈……我會好好考慮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，等我的手恢復原樣了我就把信寄出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1132_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，蘭道爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了這不是我要的反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，我的回信也已經銷毀，惡作劇正式落幕。至於佩恩寫的這封假信……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，怎麼看都不像是那兩個人會說出來的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭道爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_271_arene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過留作紀念也不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
